{
  "uid": "container-logs",
  "title": "Container-Logs",
  "description": "Logs aller Container aus Loki, filterbar nach Projekt, Container, stdout/stderr und Suchbegriff.",
  "tags": ["docker", "kurs", "logs"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "projekt",
        "label": "Compose-Projekt",
        "description": "Werte kommen direkt aus Loki: alle compose_project-Labels, die Alloy gesetzt hat.",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "type": 1,
          "label": "compose_project",
          "stream": "",
          "refId": "LokiVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(compose_project)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "container",
        "label": "Container",
        "description": "Zeigt nur Container des oben gewählten Projekts. Label 'container' setzt Alloy (config.alloy).",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "type": 1,
          "label": "container",
          "stream": "{compose_project=~\"$projekt\"}",
          "refId": "LokiVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values({compose_project=~\"$projekt\"}, container)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "stream",
        "label": "Ausgabe",
        "description": "stdout = normale Ausgabe, stderr = Fehlerausgabe",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "type": 1,
          "label": "stream",
          "stream": "",
          "refId": "LokiVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(stream)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "suche",
        "label": "Suche (Groß/klein egal)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "description": "Freitext, z. B. error oder GET /. Leer = alles anzeigen.",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "So funktioniert dieses Dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Oben filtern:** *Compose-Projekt* -> *Container* -> *Ausgabe* (stdout/stderr) -> *Suche*.  \nDie Auswahllisten fragt Grafana bei **Loki** ab. Die Labels `container`, `compose_project` und `stream` hängt **Alloy** an jede Logzeile (siehe `alloy/config.alloy`).  \nDie Abfrage dahinter (LogQL), schon mit deiner aktuellen Auswahl eingesetzt:  \n`{compose_project=~\"$projekt\", container=~\"$container\", stream=~\"$stream\"} |~ \"(?i)$suche\"`  \nTeil in `{ }` = *welche* Logs (nach Labels, schnell) · Teil danach = *Zeilenfilter* (durchsucht den Text, `(?i)` = Groß-/Kleinschreibung egal)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Anzahl Logzeilen pro Container",
      "description": "Wie viele Zeilen (passend zur Suche) jeder Container pro Zeitabschnitt schreibt. Ausschläge = hier ist etwas los.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (container) (count_over_time({compose_project=~\"$projekt\", container=~\"$container\", stream=~\"$stream\"} |~ \"(?i)$suche\" [$__auto]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{container}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "right"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs",
      "description": "Neueste Zeile oben. Auf eine Zeile klicken zeigt alle Labels; mit der Lupe daneben lässt sich direkt danach filtern.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 18
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{compose_project=~\"$projekt\", container=~\"$container\", stream=~\"$stream\"} |~ \"(?i)$suche\"",
          "refId": "A",
          "maxLines": 1000,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    }
  ]
}
